ִיָּה great-great-grandfather of prophet Zephaniah Zeph 1:1 , ᵐ5 τοῦ Εξεκιου, perhaps = 1 3 ᵐ5 Εξεκια ( ς ) , חִזְקִיָּה man of royal Davidic line 1Chr 3:23 probably near time of Char. 4 ᵐ5 יְחִזְקִיָּה, Εξεκια ( ς ) , head of a family of returned exiles Ezra 2:16 = חִזְקִיָּה Neh 7:21 , compare also ׳ח 10:18 . 5 ᵐ5 יְחִזְקִיָּהוּ Εξεκιας, an Ephraimite, Ahaz's time 2Chr 28:12 .","rootNote":"or חִזְקִיָּהוּ ; also יְחִזְקִיָּה ; or יְחִזְקִיָּהוּ ; from 2388 and 3050 ; strengthened of Jah ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 3 13","keyReferences":["1Chr 3 13","1Chr 3 23","1Chr 4 41","2Chr 28 27","2Chr 29 1","2Chr 29 18","2Chr 29 20","2Chr 29 27"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":130,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 3 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חִזְקִיָּ֥הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 3 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חִזְקִיָּ֛ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 41","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְחִזְקִיָּ֣הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 28 27","book":"2Chr","chapter":28,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְחִזְקִיָּ֥הֽוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 1","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְחִזְקִיָּ֣הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 18","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חִזְקִיָּ֣הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 20","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְחִזְקִיָּ֣הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 27","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חִזְקִיָּ֔הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 30","